/-
# AggFive.Hl.Top : the lines clause for `Top.topTab` (generated by l5_hlines)

`HLines H` = the lines hypotheses of all depth-1 nodes; `lines_all` is the lines clause of the concatenated local class tables, the hypothesis `hlines` of `FiveSpeedHyps2`.
No `sorry`, no `native_decide`, no new axiom.  Not registered in any aggregator.
-/
